From e529f15762362fe61062d132d14980a95baba895 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:55:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Workstream 09: run.sh copies sources only; clippy judged on
 09's files [skip ci]

The bridge stage copied kernel/ and bridge10/ with their build
directories into its temporary tree (gigabytes; the disk filled); it
copies the sources only now. The core stage's clippy of the capacity
builds fails on a finding in workstream 09's files only and counts the
rest: workstream 4's ae0df617 has eight dead-code findings of its own in
permutation-frontier/src/crypto/quick.rs's test values (the default
build has them too), reported to workstream 4.

run.sh on the merge with ae0df617 (all stages, exit 0): kernel 43 (+4
abi), bridge10 28, workstream 10's adapter 17, core 1,837 tests, 0
failed. No key generated, derived or signed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C5Nj2Y9wne2WBMdMysfzXe
